"Company-wide Anthropic API key for the Claude terminal. If set, every user's"
" terminal uses it (1st choice); otherwise the user's own key "
"(res.users.claude_api_key, 2nd choice) is used, and if that is empty the "
"terminal login flow runs at startup. Synced from the MCP server via "
"'Reload'. Administrators only."
msgstr ""
